== Appendix A: Validation Decision Matrix ==

| Scenario | Current Behavior | Desired Behavior | Implementation |
|----------|------------------|------------------|----------------|
| Required field missing | Error displayed, #set runs with empty | Template blocked, no #set | Lua guard clause |
| Invalid vocab value | #default error, SMW stores invalid | Error displayed, no SMW write | Lua vocab check |
| Empty optional field | #set with empty value | No #set for that property | Lua conditional |
| Relationship malformed | Stored as-is | Parsed and validated | Lua parser |
| Confidence > 1.0 | Stored as-is | Error, clamped to 1.0 | Lua range check |

